{"qid": "c04", "family": "c", "split": "dev", "method": "M3", "model": "glm", "answer": {"method": "M3", "model": "glm", "final": {"answer": "The valve operated by loop FIC-13-2 is FV-13-2, a Fisher ET globe-style control valve (per the fisher-et-d100022x012 datasheet). Its trim options include standard trims 1, 4, 27, 29, 37, 37H and 57 (with temperature/pressure-drop limits per Figures 13 and 15 and Table 15), Cavitrol III one-stage and two-stage cages (trim 76, Figure 14) for cavitation service, and Whisper Trim III, Whisper NXG and WhisperFlo cages for aerodynamic noise attenuation. For high pressure drop or noise, the Whisper Trim III / Whisper NXG / WhisperFlo cages are used to attenuate aerodynamic noise in gaseous service, while the Cavitrol III cages address cavitation damage at high pressure drops in liquid service.", "not_present": false}, "outcome": "ANSWERED", "route": ["context_rag+chunks"], "cypher": [], "sources": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "pages": [18, 6, 3, 7, 26, 9, 2, 32, 25, 19, 22, 36]}], "latency_s": 3.6893605000223033, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 196529, "completion_tokens": 583, "cost_usd": 0.00721775, "spent_usd": 0.00721775, "n_calls": 2, "n_cached": 0, "models": ["qwen/qwen3-embedding-8b", "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash"]}, "trace": {"chunks": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 18, "score": 0.6762}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 6, "score": 0.6471}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 3, "score": 0.6407}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 7, "score": 0.6251}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 26, "score": 0.6237}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 9, "score": 0.6106}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 2, "score": 0.6077}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 32, "score": 0.5996}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 25, "score": 0.599}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 19, "score": 0.597}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 22, "score": 0.5931}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 36, "score": 0.593}], "prompt_chars": 486847, "reply": "{\"answer\": \"The valve operated by loop FIC-13-2 is FV-13-2, a Fisher ET globe-style control valve (per the fisher-et-d100022x012 datasheet). Its trim options include standard trims 1, 4, 27, 29, 37, 37H and 57 (with temperature/pressure-drop limits per Figures 13 and 15 and Table 15), Cavitrol III one-stage and two-stage cages (trim 76, Figure 14) for cavitation service, and Whisper Trim III, Whisper NXG and WhisperFlo cages for aerodynamic noise attenuation. For high pressure drop or noise, the Whisper Trim III / Whisper NXG / WhisperFlo cages are used to attenuate aerodynamic noise in gaseous service, while the Cavitrol III cages address cavitation damage at high pressure drops in liquid service.\", \"not_present\": false}"}}}
