ar transmitter has ¼ NPT is not stated. As for a manifold already fitted: yes, the datasheet offers direct-mount integral 3-valve (option code 3) and 5-valve (code 5) manifolds, as well as direct-mount 3-valve/5-valve manifolds in SST (D3/D5) or alloy C-276 (D4/D6) and remote-mount versions (R3/R5/R4/R6), though some manifold options are not available with flanged models above Class 600."}}}
